      "text": "Solid dub. Second half of a back-to-back, on the road, with your backup goalie in net AND with key players out due to injury. Really like the makeup of this #TBLightning team early on this season. Wins IN Minnesota, Buffalo AND Columbus?!?! I see you Bolts! #GoBolts",
