      "id": "2121071791359791537",
      "text": "HOT START, HILDY: With his 28-save win tonight, Dennis Hildeby is 4-0-1 to begin his @TBLightning career. He's just the second goalie in #GoBolts history (Sean Burke, 3-0-2 in 2005-06) to earn at least a point in each of his first five starts with the team. https://t.co/LPxi7BCE2H",
